OL,3,A'Pain of losing him is beyond words':
OL,4,AFamilies of two police officers killed
OL,5,Ain crash pay tribute
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family of PC Tom Clough, one of two
OL,8,FCleveland Police officers killed in a
OL,9,Fcar crash on the A66 near Middlesbrough
OL,10,Fon Saturday, has described him as "our
OL,11,Fhero"
OL,13,FPC Matthew Blades was also killed in
OL,14,Fthe collision - his wife says the "pain
OL,15,Fof losing him is beyond words"
OL,17,FEarlier, the force also named the five
OL,18,Foccupants of a Volkswagen Passat
OL,19,Finvolved in the incident
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
