OL,3,AGuinea rubbish landfill collapse kills
OL,4,A30
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne woman told local media her five
OL,7,Fchildren had died in the disaster.
OL,8,FThere are fears that the death toll
OL,9,Fwill rise further.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
